cff-version: 1.2.0

message: "If you use this repository, dataset, or computational workflow, please cite it."

title: "QSAR and Machine Learning Analysis of Coumarin-Based Compounds Against LPS-Induced NO Production"

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Reang"
    given-names: "Khatendra T."
    affiliation: "Department of Chemistry, Visvesvaraya National Institute of Technology, Nagpur, Maharashtra, India"

abstract: "Reproducible exploratory QSAR and machine-learning workflow for coumarin-based compounds evaluated against LPS-induced nitric oxide (NO) production. The workflow includes RDKit molecular descriptor and fingerprint generation, LASSO descriptor selection, PLS-QSAR modeling, applicability domain analysis, cross-validation, Y-randomization, external validation, and model interpretation."

keywords:
  - QSAR
  - machine learning
  - coumarin
  - RDKit
  - cheminformatics
  - PLS regression
  - LASSO
  - molecular descriptors
  - applicability domain
  - LPS-induced nitric oxide

repository-code: "https://github.com/Khaten-ChemAI/coumarin-qsar-machine-learning"
